What is Ollama?

Ollama is a tool that lets you download and run Large Language Models (LLMs) locally on your own computer.

This means you can use models like Llama, Mistral, or Gemma without sending your data to a cloud API.

Simple Explanation

Normally, when you use an AI model:

Your App
    │
    ▼
Internet
    │
    ▼
OpenAI / Groq / Google
    │
    ▼
Response

With Ollama:

Your App
    │
    ▼
Ollama
    │
    ▼
Llama Model (running on your computer)
    │
    ▼
Response

Everything runs on your own machine.

=======

What can Ollama run?

Ollama supports many open-source models, including:

🦙 Llama
💎 Gemma
🌪️ Mistral
🧠 Phi
🔷 Qwen
🧮 Code Llama
📝 DeepSeek (supported versions)

========

Why use Ollama?
Advantages
✅ Works offline
✅ No API key required
✅ Better privacy (your data stays on your computer)
✅ Free to use
✅ Easy to integrate with Python
✅ Useful for AI agents and RAG applications
Installation
Windows

Download and install from:

https://ollama.com

After installation, open a terminal.

Download a model

Example:

ollama run llama3.2

Ollama downloads the model (the first time only) and starts a chat.

Example:

>>> Hello

Hi! How can I help you today?
Other commands

List installed models:

ollama list

Remove a model:

ollama rm llama3.2

Show model information:

ollama show llama3.2
Using Ollama with Python

Install the Python package:

pip install ollama

Example:

import ollama

response = ollama.chat(
    model="llama3.2",
    messages=[
        {"role": "user", "content": "What is AI?"}
    ]
)

print(response["message"]["content"])

========
Ollama vs Groq

| Feature           | Ollama                       | Groq                      |
| ----------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Runs locally      | ✅                            | ❌                         |
| Internet required | ❌ (after downloading models) | ✅                         |
| API key required  | ❌                            | ✅                         |
| Cost              | Free                         | Free tier + paid plans    |
| Privacy           | High                         | Data sent to cloud        |
| Speed             | Depends on your computer     | Very fast cloud inference |

